  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Assistance for Victims of Sexual Exploitation and Abuse and Children Born of SEA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project incorporates lessons learned from previous projects in Haiti, implemented from 2018 until now, at different times and by different UN entities and implementing partners.1 These projects provided varying levels of assistance to female victims of SEA by former MINUSTAH (Mission des Nations Unies pour la stabilisation en Ha&#xef;ti) personnel, and their children born of SEA. This proposed 2-year project aims to support efforts to assist victims of SEA and their children born from SEA.</narrative>
  </description>
